- R3 The sweep is one array job, tasks i=0..3, n = 10^(5+i), seed `random.Random(1000+i)`, padded with sleeps of 60/180/300/480 s, so tasks end at different times. Output per task: `out/pi_i.txt` with `samples=… estimate=… abs_error=…`.
